    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">0/1 knapsack</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Subset sum</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/partition-equal-subset-sum/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 416</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Partition Equal Subset Sum</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Two equal halves exist exactly when some subset sums to total / 2, so the question is \"is total / 2 reachable?\". Keep one boolean row of reachable sums and add each number with the loop running downward. O(n * total) time, O(total) space.</p>\n"
